  dialogue:
  - '"Oh, it''s you again! Glad you made it!"'
  - '"It''s important to stay safe while on the job. It''s not a race!"'
  - '"Slow and steady. Take your time. The lifts will always come back around!"'
  - '"My missing tool should be up ahead. Remember, be careful!"  '
